    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λάχεσις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span></span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαχεῖν</span>) <u>Lachesis</u>, one of the
		three Fates, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Disposer of
			lots</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				218
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sc.</u>
				258
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.64
			</span></i>, etc.; as the goddess of <i>distribution</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.644a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				401b20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Appellat., <i>lot, destiny</i>, Bacis ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.43
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοιρῶν Λαχέσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).602.8
				</span></i>
			 (Sparta, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>).</div>
